  "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept\nAsset type: source-aligned top-down JRPG obstacle-only production layer\nInput images: Image 1 is a style, palette, lighting, scale, and material reference only; Image 2 is the exact obstacle placement and obstacle-kind guide\nPrimary request: create only the low static obstacles indicated by Image 2: clipped leafy hedges for hedge regions, low weathered stone or timber walls for low-wall regions, and low roots or rocks for root-rock regions\nScene/backdrop: perfectly flat solid #ff00ff chroma-key background for local background removal\nStyle/medium: match Image 1's illustrated top-down JRPG village style, palette, lighting, texture, and scale\nComposition/framing: preserve Image 2's exact 7:6 canvas layout, coordinates, footprints, and top-down camera\nConstraints: the background must be one uniform #ff00ff color with no shadows, gradients, texture, reflections, floor plane, or lighting variation; render obstacle silhouettes only; keep every obstacle low enough for the supplied collision footprint; crisp readable edges; no cast shadow; no contact shadow; no terrain; no grass; no roads; no paths; no water; no buildings; no doors; no landmarks; no characters; no guides; no labels; no text; no watermark; do not use #ff00ff anywhere in the obstacle art\nAvoid: rectangular terrain strips, background scenery, moved geometry, tall occluders, halos, magenta fringe, extra objects\n",
